        <p><span style="color:$gold;"><strong>Add-on modules:</strong></span> <span style="color:$cream;">AI assistant · online store · art-cinema streaming · extended digital twin · data API · multilingual layer</span></p>
  - elementId: note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 446, 832, 40]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$mutedDark"
      text: The museum contracts its own cloud infrastructure — cents at a typical collection's scale. That is what keeps our marginal cost per museum near zero.
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 506, 36, 16]
    content: {fontFamily: Inter, fontSize: 9, color: "$mutedDark", align: [right, top], text: "05"}
